Summary: Plan is well-scouted and architecturally sound (all 4 phase files present, core claims verified), but it misses a real blast radius — `bn.code` joins without `is_active` flip staged solana/tron rows from rejected to publishable — plus a guaranteed `testdb` count-assertion break and two factual/spec inaccuracies.
Concerns/Blockers: 6 required amendments listed above, chiefly: add `AND bn.is_active` to the four labels staging/publish joins (or document the residual), update `testdb_integration_test.go` network-count assertion, fix the `queries/wallets.sql` 'evm' miscitation, and document the EVM-only `Address` pattern regex alongside the enum extension.
